# ML Classification Starter Kit

A beginner-friendly notebook workflow for understanding binary classification datasets before building machine learning models.

This project focuses on the essential steps required before model optimization. The goal is to help beginners understand the dataset, prepare the data correctly, and discover the most suitable baseline model through a simple and structured workflow.

---

## Workflow

Dataset

↓

01 EDA

↓

02 Cleaning

↓

03 Baseline Benchmark

↓

Best Model
+
Feature Importance
+
Top Feature Recommendation

