## Notebook Overview

### 01 EDA

Purpose

- Load dataset
- Dataset overview
- Missing values
- Duplicate values
- Outlier detection
- Target distribution
- Summary

Output

- Dataset understanding
- HTML EDA report

---

### 02 Cleaning

Purpose

- Handle missing values
- Remove duplicates
- Handle outliers
- Drop unnecessary columns
- Export cleaned dataset

Output

- Clean dataset

---

### 03 Baseline Benchmark

Purpose

- Feature encoding
- Class balancing (SMOTE)
- Train/Test Split
- Benchmark multiple classification models
- Model evaluation
- Feature importance ranking
- Top feature recommendation

Output

- Best baseline model
- ROC AUC comparison
- Feature importance
- Recommended features

